rn the old books."},{"t":"fut","p":0,"lat":"ghadi n7req l-wraq ghedda","ar":"غادي نحرق الورق غدا","en":"I'm going to burn the papers tomorrow."},{"t":"fut","p":0,"neg":true,"lat":"ma ghadish n7req l-khobz had l-merra","ar":"ما غاديش نحرق الخبز هاد المرة","en":"I won't burn the bread this time."},{"t":"fut","p":1,"lat":"ghadi t7req yedek b l-berrad","ar":"غادي تحرق يدك بالبراد","en":"You're going to burn your hand with the teapot."},{"t":"fut","p":1,"neg":true,"lat":"ma ghadish t7req l-ktub dyali","ar":"ما غاديش تحرق الكتب ديالي","en":"You won't burn my books."},{"t":"fut","p":2,"lat":"ghadi t7erqi l-bsel ghedda","ar":"غادي تحرقي البصل غدا","en":"You (f.) are going to burn the onions tomorrow."},{"t":"fut","p":2,"neg":true,"lat":"ma ghadish t7erqi l-wraq f d-dar","ar":"ما غاديش تحرقي الورق فالدار","en":"You (f.) won't burn the papers at home."},{"t":"fut","p":3,"lat":"ghadi y7req l-7atab l-lila","ar":"غادي يحرق الحطب الليلة","en":"He's going to burn wood tonight."},{"t":"fut","p":3,"neg":true,"lat":"ma ghadish y7req l-merqa dyali","ar":"ما غاديش يحرق المرقة ديالي","en":"He won't burn my soup."},{"t":"fut","p":4,"lat":"ghadi t7req l-kwaghet dyalha ghedda","ar":"غادي تحرق الكواغط ديالها غدا","en":"She's going to burn her papers tomorrow."},{"t":"fut","p":4,"neg":true,"lat":"ma ghadish t7req l-3sha l-lila","ar":"ما غاديش تحرق العشا الليلة","en":"She won't burn dinner tonight."},{"t":"fut","p":5,"lat":"ghadi n7erqu l-bukhur f l-3id","ar":"غادي نحرقو البخور فالعيد","en":"We're going to burn incense at Eid."},{"t":"fut","p":5,"neg":true,"lat":"ma ghadish n7erqu z-zbel hna","ar":"ما غاديش نحرقو الزبل هنا","en":"We won't burn the trash here."},{"t":"fut","p":6,"lat":"ghadi t7erqu d-dar b had n-nar","ar":"غادي تحرقو الدار بهاد النار","en":"You (pl.) are going to burn the house with this fire."},{"t":"fut","p":6,"neg":true,"lat":"ma ghadish t7erqu l-kwaghet dyalna","ar":"ما غاديش تحرقو الكواغط ديالنا","en":"You (pl.) won't burn our papers."},{"t":"fut","p":7,"lat":"ghadi y7erqu z-zbel ghedda f s-sba7","ar":"غادي يحرقو الزبل غدا فالصباح","en":"They're going to burn the trash tomorrow morning."},{"t":"fut","p":7,"neg":true,"lat":"ma ghadish y7erqu l-wraq dyalhum","ar":"ما غاديش يحرقو الورق ديالهم","en":"They won't burn their papers."}]
